1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Two totally different problems

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
— same tiny part.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,500
Temp gauge climbs fast.

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000
Engine overheats within minutes of driving.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Or the opposite — heater stays lukewarm,

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
gauge barely moves, gas mileage drops.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
One clue: the thermostat.

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Stuck closed traps the heat. Stuck open lets it escape.

9
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,500
Don't just top off coolant and hope

10
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,000
— the part itself may need replacing.

11
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Worth checking before it strands you or wastes gas.

12
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Stop by and we'll take a look — Nick's Tire & Auto.
